    <widget class="QLabel" name="explanation">
     <property name="text">
      <string>Riverhorse syncs when it starts, before a game boots and after it closes. A save changed on two devices is kept twice: the older copy gets "conflict" and the device name in its file name. Files replaced or removed by a sync are kept for 30 days in the savesync/backup folder of the user directory. The password is stored in settings.ini.</string>
